# Pixelette Holdings — redirect map (Next.js static export)
# Netlify / Cloudflare Pages format. Source  Destination  Status
#
# Clean directory URLs are produced natively by `trailingSlash: true`, so —
# unlike the flat prototype — no rewrite table is needed here. This file
# carries only the legacy 301s, the 410, and the fallback.
#
# The same mapping is declared in next.config.mjs so it applies automatically
# if the site ever moves to a Node runtime. Keep the two in step.
#
# Rule order matters: first match wins.

